  "result": "Perfect! All 59 tests pass. I've successfully added invoice numbering:\n\n**Created src/numbering.js:**\n- **`nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`** \u2014 Returns the next available invoice number:\n  - Format: INV-YYYY-NNNN (e.g., INV-2026-0001)\n  - Extracts year from YYYY-MM-DD date\n  - Resets counter to 0001 for each year\n  - Finds the maximum existing counter for that year and increments it\n  - Zero-pads to 4 digits\n\n**Added to src/invoices.js:**\n- **`issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)`** \u2014 Issues a draft invoice:\n  - Assigns an invoice number using nextInvoiceNumber\n  - Changes status from 'draft' to 'issued'\n  - Returns NOT_DRAFT if invoice isn't a draft\n  - Never mutates the input invoice\n\n**Tests cover:**\n- Numbering logic: starting at 0001, incrementing, year resets, zero-padding\n- Multi-year handling with proper counter resets\n- Edge cases: large counters, many existing numbers\n- issueInvoice: basic issuance, multiple lines, draft-only enforcement, input immutability",
